<title>USA: UTAH $25 MLN HOUSING BONDS REPRICED, YIELD RAISED.</title>
<headline>UTAH $25 MLN HOUSING BONDS REPRICED, YIELD RAISED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced Utah Housing Finance Agency's $25 million bond deal, raising the yield in 2010 to 5.55 percent from 5.50 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
